	[This is an official patch for the fortune that was
	 distributed in comp.sources.games.  This patch contains
	 two major parts.  The first part is a repeat of a patch
	 that was posted to comp.sources.bugs that fixes a
	 problem with the format of the part3 and 4 shar files.
	 The second part is a patch to re-insert missing ^G and
	 ^H characters that got stripped out by some mailers.
	 The first file should be fed directly to patch (i.e.
	 patch <SharFix); the second is a self-contained shell
	 script that invokes patch to do its work.	-br]

